{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/items/445942/", "pk": 445942, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/", "pk": 335, "shortname": "bodyglove", "name": "Body Glove Hawaii", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Super-Raft Sunset Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 12, "unicode": "Super-Raft Sunset Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 6.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 2375, "description": "Prepare yourself for an unforgettable evening filled with breathtaking views, tranquil waters, and a touch of indulgence.\n\nAs we set sail, leave your worries behind and allow the soothing sounds of the ocean to whisk you away. Our Super Raft boasts ample space and comfortable seating, providing the perfect vantage point for witnessing nature's most awe-inspiring spectacle—the coastal sunset.\nWith no particular destination in mind, we allow the natural beauty of the coastline to guide our journey. Feel the gentle breeze caress your face as we navigate along the shimmering waters, passing by hidden coves, picturesque cliffs, and golden sandy beaches. The ever-changing colors of the sky create a mesmerizing backdrop, painting the horizon in hues of orange, pink, and gold.\n\nTo add to the experience we offer a selection of fine alcoholic beverages available for purchase. Sip on a cocktail or raise a beer as you toast to the beauty of the setting sun. Indulge in the moment and create lasting memories with your loved ones or fellow travelers.\n\nThroughout the tour, our experienced crew will provide commentary about the coastal landmarks and local marine life that call this region home. Feel free to engage with them, ask questions, and deepen your understanding of the area's rich history and ecological importance.\nAs the sun gracefully dips below the horizon, casting a golden glow across the water, embrace the tranquility of the moment. Capture stunning photographs to preserve this memory forever or simply relish in the serene ambiance.\n\nWhether you're seeking a romantic outing, a unique way to celebrate a special occasion, or simply a moment of relaxation and beauty, our Super-Raft Sunset Tour promises an enchanting experience. \n\nBook your spot now and get ready to create memories that will last a lifetime!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Kailua Kona", "booking_notes": "#Mahalo for booking with Body Glove Cruises\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you for your Super-Raft Sunset Tour!\n\nFree parking is available at our retail shop in Ilima Court Shopping Center. The address is 75-5629 Kuakini Highway, Kailua Kona, HI 96740. It's about a 5-7 minute walk down to the pier. Boarding begins 30 minutes prior to departure.\n\n##Discover unique, locally made treasures in our gift shop—show this email for 10% off your purchase!\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/3N450zzPQ66ojeJPrGyo)\n***\n\n#Boat Information:\n\n- This tour takes place on the [Kona Explorer](https://www.bodyglovehawaii.com/our-boat), our 41 ft. Super Raft.\n- Please note that our vessel is a **SMOKE FREE** vessel.\n- Our boat requires you to be physically agile and able to navigate the boarding process with ease, this is to ensure the safety of all passengers and crew on board.\n- If you have concerns about your ability to board the boat, we encourage you to speak with one of our crew members who will be happy to assist you in finding the best solution.\n\n#Included On This Trip:\n\n- Hawaiian inspired cuisine\n- Front row seats to the sunset\n\n#Special Dietary Requests:\nFor gluten-free, vegetarian, or vegan meals, please call 800.551.8911 at least **48 hours** before your adventure.\n\n##Due to extreme exposure to Fun & Excitement, we unfortunately cannot welcome children five years and younger, or pregnant woman on this tour.##", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "2.5 hours • Experience the beauty of the golden hour from a new perspective", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/items/445942/images/937980/", "pk": 937980, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ynvyZhkHRHe5FQuR8QnP", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ynvyZhkHRHe5FQuR8QnP", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/items/445942/"}, "crop": {"x": 0, "y": 177, "width": 2560, "height": 1347, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0mN1NwIQu0Pq0kBQCl3g"}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0mN1NwIQu0Pq0kBQCl3g", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0mN1NwIQu0Pq0kBQCl3g", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/items/445942/images/937981/", "pk": 937981, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/2wYirzLSD22A5OLoCr5V", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/2wYirzLSD22A5OLoCr5V", "comp